title: "gelimo: High-Throughput Generalized Phylogenetic Linear Models in Rust and R"
abstract: "An ultra-fast, memory-efficient engine for Phylogenetic Generalized Least Squares (PGLS) designed for genome-wide orthogroup screening and comparative evolutionary genomics."
